        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\n\nconst summary = {\n  status: '✅ AutoGrow Pipeline Complete!',\n  timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n  message: 'Instagram Reel + YouTube Shorts dono publish ho gaye!'\n};\n\nconsole.log('🎉 Done!', JSON.stringify(summary));\n\nreturn [{ json: summary }];"
      },
      "id": "b262c676-703e-4aa1-8689-fa3cc706be59",
      "name": "System • Pipeline Complete",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# BUYER SETUP GUIDE\n\n## Required services\n- n8n\n- Google Gemini API\n- HeyGen API\n- Meta / Instagram Graph API\n- YouTube Data API\n\n## Environment variables\n- `GEMINI_API_KEY`\n- `CONTENT_LANGUAGE`\n- `HEYGEN_API_KEY`\n- `HEYGEN_AVATAR_ID`\n- `HEYGEN_VOICE_ID`\n- `HEYGEN_VOICE_SPEED`\n- `HEYGEN_BACKGROUND_COLOR`\n- `INSTAGRAM_ACCOUNT_ID`\n- `INSTAGRAM_ACCESS_TOKEN`\n- `YOUTUBE_ACCESS_TOKEN`\n- `YOUTUBE_CATEGORY_ID`\n- `YOUTUBE_PRIVACY_STATUS`\n\n## Setup order\n1. Add buyer-owned credentials.\n2. Configure the HeyGen avatar and voice.\n3. Configure Instagram API access.\n4. Configure YouTube API access.\n5. Submit one test topic through the form.\n6. Verify generated script.\n7. Verify HeyGen video.\n8. Test Instagram publishing.\n9. Test YouTube publishing.\n10. Activate only after end-to-end testing.\n\nWorkflow is inactive by default.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 650,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        -520
      ],
      "id": "7ec1eb79-d5a2-4daf-958a-989fc8f8c480",
      "name": "NOTES • Buyer Setup Guide"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# PRODUCTION SAFETY & LIMITATIONS\n\n### AI output\nReview scripts and captions for factual accuracy, brand safety and sensitive topics.\n\n### HeyGen processing\nVideo creation is asynchronous. The workflow waits and retries the status check before continuing.\n\n### Social platform permissions\nInstagram and YouTube require correctly configured accounts and API permissions. Availability can vary by account/setup.\n\n### Publishing\nStart with controlled/test publishing. YouTube defaults to a private status through the configurable variable until the buyer changes it.\n\n### Identity\nDo not use a real person's avatar or voice without appropriate authorization.\n\n### Credentials\nNever ship or reuse source credentials. Use buyer-owned credentials and environment variables.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 650,
        "color": 1
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        -520
      ],
      "id": "2a35e066-cfa4-48d5-927c-21c2f7a31389",
      "name": "NOTES • Production Safety & Limits"
    }
  ],
